| Step | Command | Observed |
|---|---|---|
| Red | `npx tsx --test server/write.test.ts` | **15 failed / 0 passed**. Every request returned Fastify's route-not-found 404 (`actual: 404, expected: 200/400/409`), i.e. the route did not exist. |
